# Line endings are handled in a separate, announced change (see AGENTS.md,
# section 6). A global `* text=auto eol=lf` is deliberately NOT set here yet:
# it would renormalize every legacy CRLF file at once and invalidate all
# branches open at that moment. Binary and generated files are marked below;
# none of these rules rewrites a text file.

# Binary: never diff as text, never convert.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.webp binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.svg binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf binary
*.otf binary
*.glb binary
*.gltf binary
*.fbx binary
*.blend binary
*.babylon binary
*.ktx2 binary
*.hdr binary
*.exr binary
*.zip binary
*.gz binary
*.7z binary
*.mp3 binary
*.ogg binary
*.wav binary

# Generated or vendored: keep them out of review noise. `linguist-generated`
# collapses the file in the GitHub diff, it does not hide it.
package-lock.json -diff linguist-generated
shared/src/featurePiecesData.json linguist-generated
shared/src/roomPiecesData.json linguist-generated
shared/src/dungeonsData.json linguist-generated
shared/src/prefabs.json linguist-generated
wov-web/static/assets/js/vorschau.js linguist-generated
